	)
	(text_box "Bus Voltage Monitoring\n- Rbus1 = 2*49.9k = 99.8k, Rbus2 = 4.7k => K_attenuation = 0.04498\n- Expect VM_max = 60V, but measurement clips at 73.4V for headroom\n- {60, 73.4} [V] -> {2.70, 3.3} V\n- Used to determine Virtual Neutral Point in-software as opposed to hardware"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 134.62 0)
		(size 104.14 12.7)
